; fennec-mongo.backend — the storage SEAM (Backend.S + query) + the in-memory minimongo backend (Mini).
; PURE (bson + minimongo), so it cross-compiles to JavaScript: the reactive layer (fennec.pulse) depends
; ONLY on this, never on the native backends. The native concrete backends + Dynamic selector + mongosh
; wire endpoint live in fennec-mongo.dynamic (which links libmongoc + LMDB and is server-only).
(library
 (name fennec_mongo_backend)
 (public_name fennec-mongo.backend)
 (libraries fennec-mongo.bson fennec-mongo.minimongo))
